{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "label": "Coin-HSL Linear Solver Integration - Design", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": "Prashant Kumar (with Claude Code)", "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design_env_var_first_resolver", "label": "Decision A1: env-var-first HSL config resolver", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "HSL location resolves COINHSL_DIR env var -> explicit hsl_dir kwarg -> seeded default -> None, so configuration is portable across machines/clones and nothing machine-specific is required in committed code."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design_preflight_probe_mumps_fallback", "label": "Decision B1: one-time pre-flight probe with MUMPS fallback", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "IPOPT loads HSL lazily at solve time, not at nlpsol construction, so a try/except around construction cannot catch a missing DLL. Instead solve a trivial 1-variable NLP with the requested solver+hsllib before the real solve; on DYNAMIC_LIBRARY_FAILURE/Invalid_Option/exception warn and downgrade opts to mumps. Cached per (solver, hsllib), ~1 ms once per process. Preserves the 'never crash on a missing DLL' guarantee."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design_single_chokepoint", "label": "_make_solver as the single solver chokepoint", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All four MLTP entry points funnel through build_and_solve_nlp -> _make_solver -> nlpsol, so the linear-solver change is localised and benefits every script with no per-script edits."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design_hsl_dir_hint", "label": "_hsl_dir private opts hint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "userOpts carries only user intent: it sets ctx.opts['ipopt']['linear_solver'] and stashes the raw hsl_dir under the CasADi-invisible key ctx.opts['_hsl_dir']; _make_solver always pops it before nlpsol, so no path logic is duplicated in userOpts."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design_ma86_exclusion", "label": "ma86 excluded from defaults", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ma86 segfaulted in a no-DLL loader probe, so only ma57/ma97/ma27/mumps are offered; ma57 is the default."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design_feasibility_dll_loading_recipe", "label": "Proven Windows DLL loading recipe", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verified on CasADi 3.7.2: os.add_dll_directory(bin) + prepend bin to PATH + hsllib=full path to libhsl.dll solves on ma57/ma27/ma97. CasADi's bundled IPOPT already has IpLibraryLoader (no rebuild); the CoinHSL_jll v2024.5.15 MinGW/libgfortran5 bin is ABI-matched and self-contained (own OpenBLAS/METIS/gfortran runtime)."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design_linear_solver_bottleneck", "label": "Problem: KKT factorisation dominates the 23-state solve", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The 23-state solve was too slow with MUMPS because the symmetric-indefinite KKT factorisation dominates wall time; HSL is typically several times faster. The old _make_solver forced mumps and stripped hsllib/ma* as a defensive guard against a missing DLL crashing a solve."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design_bench_linear_solver", "label": "Linear-solver benchmark deliverable", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Solve the real 23-state MLTP across mumps/ma57/ma97 on a small synthetic circuit and tabulate status, iteration count, wall time and the linear-solver vs function-eval split from solver.stats() t_wall_* timings, to confirm the bottleneck and quantify the win."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "functions_transcription_make_solver", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "functions_transcription_build_and_solve_nlp", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "functions_hsl_resolve_hsl_dir", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "functions_hsl_hsllib_path", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "functions_hsl_register_hsl_dll_dir", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "functions_hsl_probe_linear_solver", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "functions_hsl_apply_linear_solver", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "useropts_useropts", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "mltp_mltp", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "mltp_initial_mltp_initial", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "mltp_paramoptim_mltp_paramoptim", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "mltp_tyreoptim_mltp_tyreoptim", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "vehmodel_vehmodel", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_06_23_coin_hsl_linear_solver_design", "target": "bench_linear_solver_bench", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-06-23-coin-hsl-linear-solver-design.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_sup